      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "📰 SOURCE DENYLIST\n\nWikipedia, Reddit, Substack, Medium, Forbes contributor,\nYahoo aggregator — blocked at agent boundary. Curated\nallowlist per sub-category surfaces only trader-grade outlets;\noff-list survivors get an 'unverified' badge.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "📰 SOURCE DENYLIST\n\nWikipedia, Reddit, Substack, Medium, Forbes contributor,\nYahoo aggregator — blocked at agent boundary. Curated\nallowlist per sub-category surfaces only trader-grade outlets;\noff-list survivors get an 'unverified' badge.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14
    },

