      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "♻️ SELF-HEALING NEWS\n\nExa retries 3× × 3 query variants with 429 Retry-After.\nFalls through to Polymarket comments → provider web search.\n6 h LRU cache hides transient failures behind any prior\nsuccess. Diagnostic only when truly stuck.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "♻️ SELF-HEALING NEWS\n\nExa retries 3× × 3 query variants with 429 Retry-After.\nFalls through to Polymarket comments → provider web search.\n6 h LRU cache hides transient failures behind any prior\nsuccess. Diagnostic only when truly stuck.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
